  {
   "start": 0.94,
   "end": 4.38,
   "text": " 10 out of 10 marketing skills for cloud that everyone needs but they get increasingly"
  },
  {
   "start": 4.38,
   "end": 7.04,
   "text": " more powerful and this is absolutely insane."
  },
  {
   "start": 7.88,
   "end": 11.24,
   "text": " Number one is the head of content skill by brad automates, it tracks top creators and"
  },
  {
   "start": 11.24,
   "end": 13.12,
   "text": " turns their patterns into your next content."
  },
  {
   "start": 14.3,
   "end": 18.52,
   "text": " Number two is the AI SEO skill, it rewrites your content so AI engines like chatgbt and"
  },
  {
   "start": 18.52,
   "end": 23.94,
   "text": " cloud can actually rank it and this is what cut cut and this is what some software is charged"
  },
  {
   "start": 23.94,
   "end": 25.32,
   "text": " thousands of dollars for."
  },
  {
   "start": 26.0,
   "end": 30.34,
   "text": " Number three is the brand guideline skill, it applies a full brand system so you cut cut,"
  },
  {
   "start": 30.84,
   "end": 34.02,
   "text": " it applies a full brand system to your business like colors, fonts and voice."
  },
  {
   "start": 34.48,
   "end": 38.3,
   "text": " Number four is the anthropic marketing plugin, just one install gives you six commands and it's"
  },
  {
   "start": 38.3,
   "end": 43.06,
   "text": " wired straight into hudspot, cut cut, just one install gives you six commands and it's wired"
  },
  {
   "start": 43.06,
   "end": 45.22,
   "text": " straight into hubspot, slack, canva and clavio."
  },
  {
   "start": 46.540000000000006,
   "end": 50.64,
   "text": " Number five is the marketing council skill, it simulates an entire board of marketing experts"
  },
  {
   "start": 50.64,
   "end": 54.62,
   "text": " debating your strategy before you commit to it and number six is the let's see skill."
  },
  {
   "start": 56.94,
   "end": 62.44,
   "text": " It finds real creators and b2b leads across a hundred life sources then verifies each email"
  },
  {
   "start": 62.44,
   "end": 66.36,
   "text": " before you reach out and number seven is the campaign launcher at OSS, cut cut."
  },
  {
   "start": 66.74,
   "end": 70.86,
   "text": " Number seven is the campaign launcher OSS, it actively plans and launches a multi-channel"
  },
  {
   "start": 70.86,
   "end": 72.3,
   "text": " ad campaign directly for your business."
  },
  {
   "start": 79.53999999999999,
   "end": 82.44,
   "text": " If you want the full marketing skills, cut cut."
  },
  {
